                                           skos:prefLabel "FunctionalMaterial"@en ;
                                           :elucidation "Materials categorised for what they do rather than what they hold up. They are designed to react to their environment, convert energy, or process information."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_1f5e3e7e_72c9_40d4_91dd_ae432d7b7018
