###  https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_4c1f58cd_6e2c_48fb_8098_1cbb762abb05
:EMMO_4c1f58cd_6e2c_48fb_8098_1cbb762abb05 rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                           rdfs:subClassOf :EMMO_4db521a3_f80f_436b_b9c7_e4b52b1383ea ;
