###  https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_f1025834_0cd2_42a1_bfeb_13bec41c8655
:EMMO_f1025834_0cd2_42a1_bfeb_13bec41c8655 rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                           rdfs:subClassOf :EMMO_220b7201_d277_4dca_bf6a_5a5e2c4062dd ,
                                                           :EMMO_f00fb163_48c9_4c59_b6c2_4205c082aa54 ;
                                           rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://dictionary.iucr.org/Crystal> ;
                                           skos:altLabel "CrystallineMaterial"@en ;
                                           skos:prefLabel "CrystallineState"@en ;
                                           :elucidation "A material is a crystal if it has essentially a sharp diffraction pattern. The word essentially means that most of the intensity of the diffraction is concentrated in relatively sharp Bragg peaks, besides the always present diffuse scattering."@en ;
                                           :iupacReference <https://doi.org/10.1351/goldbook.12754> ;
                                           :note """A crystalline state cannot be gaseous. In fact, in a gas we observe:
a) Thermal Dominance: The kinetic energy kB T of the particles completely overwhelms any attractive intermolecular forces
b) Mean Free Path: Gas particles are separated by vast distances relative to their size and are in constant, chaotic, random motion. They collide and scatter continuously.
Because a gas has absolutely zero correlation between the position and orientation of neighboring particles over time, it possesses no translational or orientational order which is the definition of a crystalline state."""@en .

[ rdf:type owl:Axiom ;
   owl:annotatedSource :EMMO_f1025834_0cd2_42a1_bfeb_13bec41c8655 ;
   owl:annotatedProperty skos:prefLabel ;
   owl:annotatedTarget "CrystallineState"@en ;
   :etymology "From Ancient Greek κρύσταλλος (krústallos, “clear ice”), from κρύος (krúos, “frost”) [Wiktionary]"@en
 ] .


###  https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_f678173d_f036_4df1_a86b_2894560be617
:EMMO_f678173d_f036_4df1_a86b_2894560be617 rdf:type owl:Class ;
